## Checklist

When implementing motion:
- [ ] Use GSAP, not CSS transitions for complex sequences
- [ ] Use `gsap.timeline()` for multi-step animations
- [ ] Use `power4.out` or `expo.out` easing
- [ ] Consider shared-element transition if two UI states share position
- [ ] Add `will-change` in CSS for performance
- [ ] Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`
- [ ] Prevent content flash (set initial hidden state in CSS, avoid falsy OR operators)

